<title>UK: Zeneca no comment on Sanofi speculation.</title>
<headline>Zeneca no comment on Sanofi speculation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zeneca Group Plc on Friday declined comment on speculation of an alliance with Sanofi, as speculation of a merger with the French group helped push Zeneca shares sharply higher.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Zeneca said the company had a policy of not commenting on market speculation.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
